linuxdevstackbox (0.1.25-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Arch CI installs the declared runtime dependency stack and builds
    with makepkg --syncdeps.
  * Single debhelper compatibility declaration (debhelper-compat = 13).
  * Cargo builds use --locked so the committed Cargo.lock is enforced
    while crates resolve in fresh build environments.

 -- MAM <mamsm-dev@users.noreply.github.com>  Sat, 31 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000

linuxdevstackbox (0.1.24-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Automated release pipeline: GitHub Actions builds the Arch, Debian,
    Fedora and AppImage artifacts from version tags and publishes
    releases with a SHA256SUMS file.
  * Correct Debian build dependencies; declare only apt-providable
    packages and document the environment-provided Node/Rust toolchains.
  * Fix CI container git ownership handling and non-root .SRCINFO
    generation.

 -- MAM <mamsm-dev@users.noreply.github.com>  Sat, 31 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000

linuxdevstackbox (0.1.22-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First Linux-only release: the Windows platform is removed entirely.
  * Apache, MariaDB/MySQL and PHP are managed from distribution packages
    with per-user XDG configuration; the application runs unprivileged.
  * Native .deb packaging with declared runtime dependencies, desktop
    entry and icons.

 -- MAM <mamsm-dev@users.noreply.github.com>  Sat, 31 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
